*
!.gitignore

# Everything here is ignored by default. Only named fixtures are tracked, and a
# new project stays local unless it is added below on purpose.
#
#   default             the starter project: characters, animations, audio,
#                       UI and one starter room. Its project.ron is
#                       include_str!'d into psxed-project and its assets seed
#                       every new project, so the build needs it on disk.
#   graybox-reach       the base project every grid project borrows its
#                       player, camera, sky and assets from
#   grid-cathedral, grid-level008, grid-dungeon, grid-cave, grid-sewers,
#   grid-west          the six grid reference levels (permanent: the grid
#                      importer is gone, these are the fixtures). Each links
#                      its `assets` to ../graybox-reach/assets; its baked/
#                      directory is regenerated and stays ignored.
#
# Superseded level projects (0.2, 0.3, 0.4, null-choir-texture-kit, mantis,
# tech-demo) are local-only, same arrangement as editor/archive/legacy-grid/.
!default/
!default/**
!graybox-reach/
!graybox-reach/**
!grid-cathedral/
!grid-cathedral/**
!grid-level008/
!grid-level008/**
!grid-dungeon/
!grid-dungeon/**
!grid-cave/
!grid-cave/**
!grid-sewers/
!grid-sewers/**
!grid-west/
!grid-west/**
# The octagonal tower test level of docs/grid/multi-storey.md section 8, built
# only with the MCP tools (editor/crates/psxed-mcp/tests/grid_tower.script).
!grid-tower/
!grid-tower/**
# The sim-state gate fixture (tools/grid-simgate): three rooms in a row joined
# by ghosted openings, the last with a one click step, the player in the first.
!grid-gate/
!grid-gate/**
# The New Project template: the starter room File > New Grid Project makes.
!grid-starter/
!grid-starter/**
# The per-user editor view file inside a tracked project stays local.
**/.psxed-view.ron

# Animation-generation auditions and review renders are local working inputs.
# Cooked runtime clips under assets/animations remain tracked.
default/source_assets/**/animations/candidates/
default/source_assets/**/animations/previews/
default/source_assets/**/previews/
**/cooked/
**/baked/
**/.mcp-backups/
**/logs/
# Emulator/editor screen grabs: working output, regenerated on demand.
**/captures/
